31,1,1,talk,Rin,,Everyone! I have a secret! Asuka is the werewolf! I saw it in my magic mirror!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"That was fast. Rin, are you claiming to be the Seer?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,A claim on the very first turn. This is a very aggressive strategy.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Asuka,,That is a blatant lie. I am a villager. Rin is trying to frame me.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Interesting. The child plays the Seer, and the adult denies it. Who is lying?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm not lying! I'm the Seer! Asuka is the bad wolf!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
