38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,It doesn't matter what she claims. The question is whether we trust Rin's divination.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I am a simple villager. Rin is likely the werewolf trying to eliminate me early.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, you're being very neutral. Are you protecting Asuka, or just observing?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
