43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"True, but a werewolf claiming Seer on day one is a high-risk move.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Exactly. It's a desperate attempt to seize control of the vote.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I find Rin's confidence amusing. I'm inclined to trust the ""magic mirror"" for now.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Rin,,See! Shion believes me!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Toshio,,The logic of the risk suggests Rin is more likely the Seer.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
